variable precision shading:


Position only shading
https://patents.justia.com/patent/9824412

Cull Pipe and Replay Pipe

frustum culling, backface culling, degenerate, zero area

Generate a visiblity map

User Clip Planes
----

Issue: Any triangle not rejected is executed twice and the position only shading is on the critical path

cull pipe has no clipper (trivial in-out tests for frustum culling, replay can do the detailed clipping)

you can turn on/off this feature based on #vertices in the draw call

It is essentially a runahead of Geometry culling

you can also do z-max occlusion. Store max Z per Tile, if incoming triangles fit entirely in the Tile and their min is greater Tile Z.max, then trivially reject it

Pixel Shader UAV writes should disable the Cull pipe

